              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nettajulle"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Topped the toast with pecorino-romano grated cheese and broiled both sides to make the bottoms of the slices crunchy as well. Came out delicious! Will make it again!",
            "datePublished": "2019-09-05T21:59:27.880Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
