            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Caeles"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this with Ciabatta and it really knocked out socks off! At first I was just going to use 2 roasted cloves of garlic but then I saw this recipe and added one raw, chopped clove. Also some leftover garlic/Rosemary/salt rub from the steaks we grilled for dinner. Skipped the mozzarella and oregano. We grilled this on the BBQ open because we ran out of foil. Let me tell you BEST GARLIC BREAD EVER!",
            "datePublished": "2016-04-23T05:50:46.620Z"
          },
